{
    "title": "Like Nastya: Party Time",
    "description": "We have finally released our exciting new kids game for boys and girls. The main character is a real youtube princess, Like Nastya! Unforgettable adventures of Like Nastya and her friends are available for kids all around the world. There are a lot of interesting tasks, beautiful clothes, tasty dishes and funny surprises. Videos with Nastya\u2019s birthday party have millions of views on YouTube and now every kid can take part in a birthday party of a little princess.\r\n\r\nNastya\u2019s parents have prepared the funniest kids games for her and her friends. Boys and girls will have fun in different places. But firstly, we need to invite best friends to the party. We will make the most beautiful postcards and send them by post. And also we will cook some food. All kids like to bake and decorate cakes. Wi will also play an exciting dress up game, where we will choose clothes for boys and girls and will make stylish hairstyles and makeups.\r\n\r\nPostcards are sent, the cake is decorated, and clothes are ready. So what will we do next? Our kids party can take place at different locations. We have prepared some mini games at the beach. Nastya and her friends will play volleyball, ride a jet ski, try diving, and drink tasty fresh juice. They will also go on a yacht trip and take photos of real dolphins.\r\n\r\nIf you want something active, go to the park. You will run, jump, play football, and try different attractions. We will have a barbecue and cook different food. We will launch a kite and play with frisbee. We will catch butterflies and visit a climbing park. And after all these activities kids will enjoy a cake or other food, which Like Nastya cooked for them. We will take photos of the best moments and post them on Instagram.\r\n\r\nThe game about Like Nastya\u2019s birthday is a great way to spend your free time with friends and have a lot of fun together. This game will develop the phantasy, creativity and communication skills of a child. A lot of game modes are adapted for different ages and abilities, that\u2019s why every kid will find an interesting task for themselves. Even preschoolers could play without any help from adults. This game about Nastya\u2019s birthday and kids party will be your favorite game. Have fun with us!",
    "descriptionHTML": "We have finally released our exciting new kids game for boys and girls. The main character is a real youtube princess, Like Nastya! Unforgettable adventures of Like Nastya and her friends are available for kids all around the world. There are a lot of interesting tasks, beautiful clothes, tasty dishes and funny surprises. Videos with Nastya\u2019s birthday party have millions of views on YouTube and now every kid can take part in a birthday party of a little princess.<br><br>Nastya\u2019s parents have prepared the funniest kids games for her and her friends. Boys and girls will have fun in different places. But firstly, we need to invite best friends to the party. We will make the most beautiful postcards and send them by post. And also we will cook some food. All kids like to bake and decorate cakes. Wi will also play an exciting dress up game, where we will choose clothes for boys and girls and will make stylish hairstyles and makeups.<br><br>Postcards are sent, the cake is decorated, and clothes are ready. So what will we do next? Our kids party can take place at different locations. We have prepared some mini games at the beach. Nastya and her friends will play volleyball, ride a jet ski, try diving, and drink tasty fresh juice. They will also go on a yacht trip and take photos of real dolphins.<br><br>If you want something active, go to the park. You will run, jump, play football, and try different attractions. We will have a barbecue and cook different food. We will launch a kite and play with frisbee. We will catch butterflies and visit a climbing park. And after all these activities kids will enjoy a cake or other food, which Like Nastya cooked for them. We will take photos of the best moments and post them on Instagram.<br><br>The game about Like Nastya\u2019s birthday is a great way to spend your free time with friends and have a lot of fun together. This game will develop the phantasy, creativity and communication skills of a child. A lot of game modes are adapted for different ages and abilities, that\u2019s why every kid will find an interesting task for themselves. Even preschoolers could play without any help from adults. This game about Nastya\u2019s birthday and kids party will be your favorite game. Have fun with us!",
